              "value": "(necromancy, primal)\n\nA gluttonworm in contact with a significant body of sand, such as a desert or beach, gains fast healing 10. If the gluttonworm is subject to persistent bleed, the flowing blood quickly congeals with the sand covering its body, instantly ending the bleed duration and giving the gluttonworm a +2 circumstance bonus to AC until the end of its next turn."
